<table border="0" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" width="100%"><tr><td>
<a href="modules.php?name=News&new_topic=20"><img src="images/topics/live.gif" border="0" Alt="Live" align="right" hspace="10" vspace="10"></a>
<div align=justify><font class="posted" color="#000000"><P id=bottom_content_area_text><STRONG>ICON PRE- SALE: PORTUGAL</STRONG></P>
<P>We are excited to announce a new ticketing presale for Madonna's <B>re-Invention Tour</B> that will take place on <B>June 8th</B>! As a member of ICON, the official Madonna Fan Club, you will have an exclusive chance at the opportunity to buy tickets early through the Icon Web site members-only ticket page, before they go on sale to the general public.<BR><BR>On June 8th, ONLY existing ICON members will have access to this general <B>Fan Club ticket pre-sale</B>. Pre-sale tickets will be available for the show listed to the left.<BR><BR>To take advantage of this chance at pre-sale tickets, just go to the <A id=section_specific_secondary_nav_links href="http://www.icon.musictoday.com" target=_blank><FONT color=#f27a03>ICON Web site</FONT></A> and click on the ticketing section. Please note that the show will not appear on the ticketing page until the show sale has opened (see the schedule for this show's pre-sale time).<BR><BR>See you at the show!<BR><BR><B>EVENT DATE<BR><BR>09/12/04</B><BR>Atlantico Pavilion<BR>Lisbon, Portugal<BR>Presale: June 8 @ 3PM Local</P>
<P><STRONG>Source: Madonna.com</STRONG></P>
</font></div>
</td></tr></table>


</td></tr></table>


