<font class="content">Written by <a href="">gugarko</a> on Saturday, June 05 @  W. Europe Daylight Time  [1 reads].</font><br>
<font class="content"">(<a href="modules.php?name=News&amp;file=article&amp;sid=3020">comments?</a> | <a href="modules.php?name=News&amp;file=categories&amp;op=newindex&amp;catid=3">Rumours</a> | Score: 0)</font>

