<TR>
<TD align=middle><STRONG><FONT size=1><SPAN class=blacktext>Hell for leather ... the new line</SPAN><BR></FONT></STRONG></TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE></P>
<P><STRONG>The clothes are aimed at girls aged between two and 16.</STRONG></P>
<P>A source said: “Madonna was inspired by her daughter <STRONG>LOURDES</STRONG>.</P>
<P>“Although she’s only six, Madonna lets her wear short skirts and make-up.”</P>
<P><STRONG>source : The Sun</STRONG></P></SPAN>
</font></div>
</td></tr></table>


